<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9147] Race between tx async rollback and lock mapping on near node can produce hanging primary tx</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9147</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I ran a simple test&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1) Start 15 servers node&lt;br/&gt;
2) Start client with long transaction&lt;br/&gt;
3) Additional start 5 client with loading in many caches (near 2 thousand)&lt;br/&gt;
4) Stop 1 server node, wait 1 minute and start it back&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Cluster freenze on more than hour&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13175863">IGNITE-9147</key>
